WEBVTT

00:31.440 --> 00:34.990
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.010 --> 00:38.390
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.660 --> 00:44.630
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.790 --> 00:49.420
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.440 --> 00:52.950
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.970 --> 00:56.460
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.480 --> 00:59.990
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.010 --> 01:06.070
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.330 --> 01:23.610
Si Jin

01:23.630 --> 01:27.610
Episode 25

01:27.610 --> 01:31.130
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

01:36.550 --> 01:39.580
Since I joined the Chiyu Cavalry,

01:39.580 --> 01:41.690
to avoid delaying the battle,

01:41.710 --> 01:43.430
I signed a military pledge.

01:43.830 --> 01:45.450
If I drink alcohol,

01:45.470 --> 01:48.070
I'll be punished by military law.

01:48.270 --> 01:51.330
I wouldn't dare defy you, Your Highness.

01:51.350 --> 01:52.710
Lang.

01:53.860 --> 01:55.790
Jin, why take it seriously?

01:55.860 --> 01:57.390
I'm just teasing you.

01:57.550 --> 01:59.060
How could I force you?

02:00.060 --> 02:01.250
Yes, Jin.

02:01.270 --> 02:02.560
You don't know.

02:02.580 --> 02:03.900
Our Crown Prince

02:03.900 --> 02:06.040
loves to joke with us.

02:06.060 --> 02:08.280
I was just kidding.

02:08.300 --> 02:10.550
Lang, don't take it seriously.

02:11.950 --> 02:13.000
Your Highness.

02:13.020 --> 02:15.210
I didn't invite you here in advance,

02:15.230 --> 02:16.890
so I'll drink as an apology.

02:20.460 --> 02:22.110
Zhang, well done.

02:23.020 --> 02:23.880
Sit down.

02:23.890 --> 02:27.160
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

02:27.180 --> 02:28.430
The golden eagle stands alone.

02:28.430 --> 02:29.490
Hurry up!

02:29.510 --> 02:30.900
Catch the little chicken!

02:30.900 --> 02:33.320
You can't catch me!

02:33.340 --> 02:36.090
You can't catch me!

02:36.110 --> 02:38.270
Catch the little chicken!

02:38.270 --> 02:39.780
You can't catch me!

02:40.020 --> 02:41.430
What's wrong?

02:41.550 --> 02:43.340
- Father.
- My waist!

02:43.520 --> 02:44.990
- Zhan, come on.
- You're so fragile.

02:44.990 --> 02:46.740
I'm getting older.

02:48.950 --> 02:49.930
A little movement

02:49.950 --> 02:51.510
could easily hurt me.

02:51.530 --> 02:52.420
But...

02:52.430 --> 02:53.620
Yan, you still want to play,

02:53.620 --> 02:54.980
right?

02:55.950 --> 02:58.310
I think it's you who wants to play.

02:59.230 --> 03:00.160
Go.

03:00.180 --> 03:02.310
Ask Si to come and play with them.

03:02.460 --> 03:03.410
Master,

03:03.430 --> 03:04.070
the servants say

03:04.070 --> 03:05.490
Miss Si is not at Haitang Chamber.

03:05.510 --> 03:07.420
She's gone to Prince Qi's Mansion.

03:09.180 --> 03:11.270
Didn't she say she wasn't going?

03:11.510 --> 03:12.940
I don't know.

03:13.140 --> 03:14.870
Grandmother must've forced her.

03:14.900 --> 03:16.530
I'll go find her right away.

03:16.550 --> 03:17.910
Father,

03:18.180 --> 03:19.490
that's an imperial mansion.

03:19.510 --> 03:21.250
We can't just barge in.

03:21.270 --> 03:22.630
Right.

03:22.830 --> 03:24.430
Why be afraid?

03:24.740 --> 03:25.740
If any noble young master

03:25.740 --> 03:27.530
wants to marry her,

03:27.550 --> 03:28.950
they won't be able to do anything

03:28.950 --> 03:30.940
as long as I don't agree.

03:31.930 --> 03:33.230
Father, are you really unwilling

03:33.230 --> 03:34.810
to let Si marry into a prominent family?

03:34.810 --> 03:36.850
Noble families have
complicated relationships.

03:36.860 --> 03:38.990
It can really make people suffer.

03:39.740 --> 03:41.020
I hope Si won't fall

03:41.020 --> 03:42.690
for any young master

03:42.710 --> 03:45.040
in Prince Qi's Mansion today.

03:45.060 --> 03:46.280
Don't worry, Father.

03:46.300 --> 03:48.270
Si has someone in mind already.

03:49.620 --> 03:50.980
Who?

03:51.110 --> 03:52.950
Uncle Yu! Uncle Yu!

03:52.950 --> 03:53.800
Uncle Yu!

03:53.800 --> 03:55.170
- Uncle Yu.
- Don't talk nonsense.

03:55.180 --> 03:56.530
Come on, let's go play over there.

03:56.530 --> 03:57.990
Yu, Yu!

03:57.990 --> 03:59.350
Come back here.

04:11.300 --> 04:12.780
Is it Commandant Yu?

04:26.380 --> 04:28.090
Commandant Yu

04:28.110 --> 04:30.340
is quite handsome.

04:30.670 --> 04:32.430
He must've attracted many ladies.

04:32.430 --> 04:33.790
That's not true.

04:33.910 --> 04:35.300
Yu is respectful and composed.

04:35.300 --> 04:38.030
I've never seen any women around him.

04:40.350 --> 04:42.540
He works at Capital Security,

04:42.590 --> 04:44.710
and his monthly salary isn't much.

04:45.110 --> 04:46.380
But he's a military officer.

04:46.380 --> 04:47.260
He's skilled

04:47.260 --> 04:48.800
and can protect Si.

04:48.820 --> 04:50.210
But what if he bullies Si?

04:50.230 --> 04:51.570
Who will teach him a lesson?

04:51.590 --> 04:52.950
Me?

04:54.150 --> 04:56.340
I can't beat him,

04:56.470 --> 04:58.330
but Yu is young,

04:58.350 --> 04:59.770
calm, and dignified.

04:59.790 --> 05:00.940
If Si marries him,

05:00.940 --> 05:02.710
he won't bully her.

05:03.140 --> 05:04.030
You're his friend,

05:04.030 --> 05:05.800
always by his side.

05:05.820 --> 05:08.210
Stop trying to persuade me.

05:08.230 --> 05:10.500
This is Si's marriage.

05:10.500 --> 05:11.940
Can you stand on your friend's side

05:11.940 --> 05:13.040
on this matter?

05:13.060 --> 05:16.390
I'm just speaking the truth.

05:16.940 --> 05:19.620
Moreover, Si...

05:19.620 --> 05:21.030
What's wrong with Si?

05:22.300 --> 05:24.150
Commandant Yu

05:24.500 --> 05:26.240
saved you, won the contest,

05:26.260 --> 05:28.630
and moved next to our house.

05:28.670 --> 05:32.070
Is it all for Si?

05:32.110 --> 05:34.700
That's because they're mutually in love.

05:34.700 --> 05:36.160
What mutual love?

05:36.180 --> 05:38.830
I think he's just taking it
step by step.

05:39.150 --> 05:41.060
I think you wouldn't be satisfied
with anyone.

05:41.060 --> 05:42.420
What did you say?

05:42.550 --> 05:44.900
You win.

05:47.730 --> 05:49.600
(Everlasting Prosperity)

05:49.620 --> 05:51.160
Cousin, you're so generous.

05:51.180 --> 05:52.430
You even brought out

05:52.430 --> 05:53.500
rare items like this.

05:53.500 --> 05:56.300
This is Shanhai Soup, a Palace dish.

05:56.590 --> 05:59.010
- It's made...
- It's made with fish and shrimp,

05:59.030 --> 06:00.800
and it smells fishy when it cools down.

06:00.820 --> 06:03.360
It's a pity to waste your kindness.

06:03.380 --> 06:06.900
Let's taste it while it's hot.

06:15.380 --> 06:17.360
I hadn't had a chance to mention

06:17.380 --> 06:19.240
that this soup has pepper in it.

06:19.260 --> 06:21.090
Though it looks mild,

06:21.110 --> 06:23.070
it's secretly spicy.

06:23.150 --> 06:25.330
Miss Jiang, are you alright?

06:25.350 --> 06:27.240
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

06:27.260 --> 06:28.890
These ingredients are precious,

06:28.910 --> 06:31.900
and today I'm fortunate to taste them.

06:31.990 --> 06:33.480
But I didn't expect

06:33.500 --> 06:35.210
the rules of Grand Preceptor's Mansion

06:35.230 --> 06:36.770
to be so overbearing.

06:36.790 --> 06:39.070
The host can even be overshadowed.

06:39.300 --> 06:41.150
Who is that noble lady?

06:41.910 --> 06:44.540
Jiang Si from Earl Dongping's family.

06:46.300 --> 06:48.590
The renowned beauty of Ling'an.

06:49.300 --> 06:50.300
Ask her to come here.

06:50.320 --> 06:51.380
It wouldn't be appropriate.

06:51.380 --> 06:52.780
Why not?

06:52.820 --> 06:54.210
There's no rush.

06:54.230 --> 06:56.030
After everyone is full and satisfied,

06:56.050 --> 06:57.650
my wife has arranged a scenic viewing.

06:57.670 --> 07:00.130
But Jin's focus is clearly

07:00.150 --> 07:00.990
on that side.

07:00.990 --> 07:02.620
I have no such intentions.

07:02.620 --> 07:03.760
Is that my intention?

07:03.760 --> 07:04.910
You may be misunderstanding.

07:04.910 --> 07:05.800
Remove the screen.

07:05.820 --> 07:07.360
That would be improper.

07:07.380 --> 07:09.590
A beauty should be viewed
under the light.

07:09.670 --> 07:11.630
The beauty of ambiguity is tempting.

07:11.670 --> 07:13.030
Through a screen and thin fabric,

07:13.030 --> 07:15.300
charm matters more than appearance.

07:15.300 --> 07:17.420
Today, I have to see her.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.790
Remove it.

07:31.700 --> 07:33.650
I'm Jiang Si
from Earl Dongping's family.

07:33.670 --> 07:35.750
Greetings, Your Highnesses.

07:35.940 --> 07:39.220
She's tall and graceful,
elegant and poised.

07:40.150 --> 07:42.100
No wonder her name is well-known.

07:42.500 --> 07:43.860
Reward her.

07:44.990 --> 07:48.150
A plate of cold fish mint.

07:50.910 --> 07:52.840
The fish mint is white,

07:52.860 --> 07:54.150
the sauce is red,

07:54.150 --> 07:55.920
and the garnish is green.

07:55.940 --> 07:58.070
It looks beautifully colored,

07:58.670 --> 08:00.590
but the taste...

08:01.230 --> 08:03.040
Since I've received your gift,

08:03.060 --> 08:06.150
I should return it with something more.

08:06.230 --> 08:08.030
Your Highness,
as the heir to the throne,

08:08.030 --> 08:10.450
you first lost concern for his brothers

08:10.470 --> 08:12.980
and then for ladies.

08:13.670 --> 08:15.330
So I present you

08:15.350 --> 08:17.240
a plate of assorted pastries

08:17.260 --> 08:19.030
to help you

08:19.260 --> 08:20.580
keep your thoughts sharp.

08:20.580 --> 08:21.440
Jiang Si.

08:21.460 --> 08:22.370
Also,

08:22.390 --> 08:24.560
I want to gift you
a cup of clear wine,

08:24.580 --> 08:26.530
so you can use water as a mirror

08:26.550 --> 08:29.350
to reflect on yourself.

08:29.430 --> 08:30.860
Jiang Si, how dare you!

08:30.860 --> 08:33.190
When did it become your place
to lecture me?

08:36.670 --> 08:38.030
Yu Jin.

08:52.750 --> 08:54.200
Well, well.

08:54.220 --> 08:56.560
You put on quite the show

08:56.580 --> 08:58.850
before all these noble ladies.

08:58.870 --> 08:59.870
Princes are

08:59.870 --> 09:01.730
in the prime of their youth.

09:01.750 --> 09:02.870
They just acted on impulse.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.050
It's surely not to the extent

09:04.060 --> 09:06.060
of harming their brotherly bond.

09:06.060 --> 09:07.810
Alright, tell me.

09:07.810 --> 09:08.820
Who was impulsive first?

09:08.820 --> 09:10.430
- And why?
- It wasn't me.

09:10.430 --> 09:11.550
I went up to stop them.

09:11.550 --> 09:13.180
I didn't fight.

09:13.300 --> 09:14.510
- Zhang.
- Yes.

09:14.510 --> 09:16.280
It's your fault.

09:16.300 --> 09:18.150
Is this the banquet you held?

09:19.750 --> 09:21.420
Father, please punish me.

09:23.910 --> 09:26.030
Zhang is always courteous.

09:26.030 --> 09:27.290
He meant well in hosting

09:27.290 --> 09:28.650
the welcoming banquet for Yu Jin.

09:28.670 --> 09:29.670
He never expected

09:29.670 --> 09:30.960
something like this to happen.

09:30.980 --> 09:32.250
He is innocent.

09:32.270 --> 09:34.580
Your Majesty, please forgive him.

09:35.060 --> 09:36.200
Crown Prince,

09:36.220 --> 09:37.270
is this the example you set

09:37.270 --> 09:38.180
for the world?

09:38.180 --> 09:39.920
It was Yu Jin who overstepped,

09:39.940 --> 09:41.180
openly attacking me.

09:41.180 --> 09:42.630
He removed the screen

09:42.670 --> 09:45.130
and commented on the ladies.

09:45.150 --> 09:46.780
He acted inappropriately.

09:47.190 --> 09:49.180
Jiang Si from Earl Dongping's family
insulted me.

09:49.180 --> 09:50.150
You provoked her.

09:50.150 --> 09:51.510
Enough!

09:56.060 --> 09:57.650
Do you know what is most taboo

09:57.670 --> 09:59.580
in the imperial family?

10:00.060 --> 10:01.870
Brotherly strife.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.100
How many tragic incidents

10:03.100 --> 10:05.200
in history are caused by such conflicts?

10:05.220 --> 10:08.030
You're brothers, and one of you
will ascend the throne.

10:08.550 --> 10:10.650
You don't behave like brothers now.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.800
Will you also disregard
your duties in the future?

10:12.820 --> 10:14.390
- I dare not.
- I am guilty.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.090
You must be severely punished

10:16.270 --> 10:17.730
so that you'll learn from this.

10:17.750 --> 10:19.050
Bring me the Palace Regulations.

10:19.060 --> 10:20.370
You'll be punished severely.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.280
Your Majesty,

10:21.300 --> 10:22.940
the other Princes can be punished

10:22.940 --> 10:24.270
according to the rules,

10:24.270 --> 10:25.240
but the 7th Prince...

10:25.240 --> 10:26.120
What's wrong with him?

10:26.120 --> 10:27.920
The 7th Prince is
without an imperial title.

10:27.920 --> 10:28.970
So what?

10:28.980 --> 10:29.980
The Palace Regulations

10:29.980 --> 10:31.370
are for imperial family members.

10:31.390 --> 10:33.550
The 7th Prince hasn't entered
the imperial genealogy,

10:33.550 --> 10:35.110
and nor does he have
an imperial title.

10:35.110 --> 10:37.340
So, he's not one of the imperial family.

10:37.340 --> 10:38.180
How dare you!

10:38.180 --> 10:40.660
Can't I punish my son?

10:41.910 --> 10:44.060
That's against the law.

10:51.870 --> 10:53.010
Fine.

10:53.030 --> 10:53.960
Tell me.

10:53.980 --> 10:56.390
Any unused characters left in titles?

10:57.060 --> 10:57.910
Yan.

10:57.910 --> 11:00.040
Then he'll be Prince Yan.

11:00.060 --> 11:02.110
Can I punish him now?

11:02.390 --> 11:04.820
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:09.550 --> 11:10.850
Your Majesty,

11:10.870 --> 11:11.940
this is serious.

11:11.940 --> 11:13.530
Your son made a mistake.

11:13.550 --> 11:15.490
As his mother,
you should also be blamed.

11:15.510 --> 11:17.650
You all need to reflect on yourselves.

11:17.670 --> 11:18.960
Alright, everyone, leave.

11:18.980 --> 11:21.390
I take my leave, Father.

11:34.980 --> 11:36.770
You promised me

11:36.790 --> 11:38.410
that I could remain as Yu Qi,

11:38.430 --> 11:39.820
but you've broken your word.

11:39.820 --> 11:41.300
You're Prince Yan now,

11:41.300 --> 11:42.900
yet you're unhappy about it?

11:51.550 --> 11:53.730
The tree desires peace,
but the wind does not stop.

11:53.750 --> 11:55.610
You want to stay in Ling'an

11:55.630 --> 11:57.540
and avoid turmoil,

11:57.670 --> 12:00.370
but it's hard to have both.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.890
You've seen it.

12:01.910 --> 12:03.460
Many in the Palace

12:03.460 --> 12:05.250
are snobs.

12:05.270 --> 12:07.540
If I don't grant you an imperial title,

12:07.820 --> 12:09.520
how will you protect yourself

12:09.550 --> 12:11.960
and those around you?

12:11.980 --> 12:13.030
I don't care about that.

12:13.030 --> 12:14.470
But I do.

12:21.220 --> 12:23.300
Alright, go back now.

12:25.100 --> 12:27.580
From now on, be more composed.

12:28.030 --> 12:30.150
After all, you're Prince Yan now.

12:30.180 --> 12:32.900
Thank you, Father.

12:36.460 --> 12:38.350
Goodbye, Your Highness.

12:47.220 --> 12:50.180
This show has come at the right time.

12:50.390 --> 12:52.150
Your Majesty is wise.

12:53.030 --> 12:54.390
Your Majesty,

12:54.910 --> 12:56.410
it's raining.

12:56.430 --> 12:59.230
The weather has been dry for so long.

13:00.390 --> 13:02.320
This is truly a good rain.

13:02.340 --> 13:03.870
Jin is a rascal.

13:04.940 --> 13:07.470
He's been a burden since birth,

13:07.820 --> 13:10.510
and he still implicates me now.

13:11.150 --> 13:12.510
Mother,

13:12.550 --> 13:13.890
please calm down.

13:13.910 --> 13:15.630
Don't get so worked up.

13:16.430 --> 13:17.790
Let's sit down.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.870
No matter what,

13:23.910 --> 13:26.110
Yu Jin is still my real brother

13:26.150 --> 13:28.080
and your real son.

13:28.100 --> 13:29.850
He's an ominous man.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.990
That's predestined since birth.

13:35.790 --> 13:36.910
But it seems Father no longer

13:36.910 --> 13:38.250
cares about that.

13:38.270 --> 13:39.460
Otherwise, why would he use

13:39.460 --> 13:40.810
the punishment of us as a pretext

13:40.810 --> 13:42.080
to promote him?

13:42.100 --> 13:43.750
He's even Prince Yan now.

13:44.460 --> 13:46.750
Father has also easily dropped

13:46.790 --> 13:48.560
Jin's rebellious return

13:48.580 --> 13:50.160
and forgotten about that.

13:50.180 --> 13:52.230
His Majesty's mind is unfathomable.

13:52.550 --> 13:54.630
Today, His Majesty elevates him,

13:55.150 --> 13:57.150
but tomorrow, he might shift

13:57.150 --> 13:59.230
all the blame to him.

14:00.820 --> 14:02.180
Zhang,

14:05.340 --> 14:06.990
do you understand?

14:07.870 --> 14:10.180
I'll just distance myself from Yu Jin.

14:10.180 --> 14:11.540
No.

14:12.060 --> 14:14.110
Since he's had an imperial title,

14:14.300 --> 14:17.150
whatever needs to be arranged
must be done.

14:17.670 --> 14:19.440
We can't let people say

14:19.460 --> 14:21.510
we lack manners.

14:23.630 --> 14:25.510
As you wish, Mother.

14:31.460 --> 14:32.580
It's raining so hard.

14:32.580 --> 14:35.150
Shall we come back another day?

14:38.340 --> 14:39.870
Is this the place?

14:40.390 --> 14:42.030
I think so.

14:42.870 --> 14:44.230
Go knock.

14:54.150 --> 14:55.220
No one's here.

14:55.220 --> 14:56.960
You should knock harder.

14:56.980 --> 14:58.780
Go, go, go.

15:04.980 --> 15:06.370
Unfortunately,

15:06.390 --> 15:07.510
he's not home.

15:07.510 --> 15:10.230
Father, shall we come back another day?

15:12.100 --> 15:13.370
Fine.

15:13.390 --> 15:15.300
I was too hasty.

15:15.460 --> 15:16.920
Upon thinking about it,

15:16.940 --> 15:18.790
we should've investigated

15:18.790 --> 15:20.300
Yu's background first.

15:20.300 --> 15:21.660
Yes.

15:21.700 --> 15:24.060
Father, he works at Capital Security

15:24.060 --> 15:25.300
and is Mr. Zhen's friend.

15:25.300 --> 15:28.250
We can inquire at Capital Security
another day.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.630
Right.

15:29.700 --> 15:30.630
Let's go now.

15:30.630 --> 15:32.350
Now? Father.

15:32.430 --> 15:33.440
It's raining so hard.

15:33.460 --> 15:34.890
Must we go so urgently?

15:34.910 --> 15:36.580
Your Grace, please have some tea.

15:36.580 --> 15:38.130
Thank you.

15:38.150 --> 15:39.510
Mr. Zhen,

15:39.820 --> 15:41.280
I came here today

15:41.300 --> 15:44.900
to inquire about something.

15:45.220 --> 15:47.040
Please, feel free to ask.

15:47.060 --> 15:48.420
Alright.

15:50.060 --> 15:52.540
Since you both work at Capital Security,

15:52.870 --> 15:55.060
you must know about the background

15:55.060 --> 15:57.060
of Commandant Yu, right?

16:00.580 --> 16:02.940
Your Grace, don't you know

16:02.940 --> 16:04.630
about his identity?

16:05.820 --> 16:08.850
I haven't looked into it in detail.

16:08.870 --> 16:10.150
I've only heard

16:10.150 --> 16:12.490
his family is prominent.

16:12.510 --> 16:15.250
With many boys in his family,

16:15.270 --> 16:17.130
he's not highly regarded,

16:17.150 --> 16:19.940
so he has to work his way up.

16:23.060 --> 16:24.620
That's what he tells you?

16:26.910 --> 16:28.670
Mr. Zhen,

16:28.670 --> 16:30.700
is there something you can't say?

16:31.270 --> 16:33.420
Young Master Zhan, please have a seat.

16:36.820 --> 16:38.510
Mr. Zhen, you're upright,

16:38.510 --> 16:40.300
honest, and reliable.

16:40.550 --> 16:43.490
This is very important to me,

16:43.510 --> 16:46.700
so please don't hide anything.

16:51.180 --> 16:52.480
The tea is cold.

16:52.500 --> 16:54.100
Let me get you some more.

17:15.940 --> 17:17.790
Here you go.

17:17.810 --> 17:18.500
Thank you.

17:18.500 --> 17:20.110
- Young Master Zhan.
- I'm not thirsty.

17:20.110 --> 17:21.890
Mr. Zhen, please go ahead.

17:21.910 --> 17:23.340
Yes, yes.

17:27.390 --> 17:29.670
Commandant Yu's identity

17:29.910 --> 17:33.060
may be a bit different

17:34.670 --> 17:37.140
from what you two imagined.

17:39.830 --> 17:41.200
A bit different?

17:41.220 --> 17:42.570
Could it be

17:42.590 --> 17:44.200
that his family

17:44.220 --> 17:46.220
isn't prominent?

17:46.220 --> 17:49.030
No, no, not at all.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.290
Could it be

17:51.310 --> 17:54.380
he's an orphan with no parents?

17:57.220 --> 17:58.580
Mr. Zhen,

17:58.670 --> 18:00.670
why so excited?

18:00.670 --> 18:02.480
Even if it's true,

18:02.500 --> 18:04.310
- it's not a big deal.
- Yes.

18:04.310 --> 18:05.760
As long as he's an upright man,

18:05.780 --> 18:08.370
it doesn't matter if his family is poor.

18:08.390 --> 18:09.910
- Your Grace.
- Yes, Mr. Zhen.

18:09.910 --> 18:12.480
Even if Yu's family is destitute,

18:12.500 --> 18:13.810
and he's alone,

18:13.830 --> 18:16.140
he's still my friend.

18:16.870 --> 18:17.810
Mr. Zhen,

18:17.830 --> 18:20.890
please tell us honestly

18:20.910 --> 18:23.270
about Commandant Yu's family.

18:23.590 --> 18:24.920
Don't worry.

18:24.940 --> 18:26.160
We can handle it.

18:26.180 --> 18:27.540
Yes.

18:28.220 --> 18:30.310
Your Grace, are you sure?

18:30.310 --> 18:32.180
- We can handle it.
- Yes.

18:32.180 --> 18:33.440
We can handle it.

18:33.460 --> 18:36.060
Actually, Commandant Yu

18:36.390 --> 18:37.750
is

18:39.020 --> 18:41.230
the seventh son of the Emperor,

18:43.870 --> 18:45.620
Prince Yan.

18:54.070 --> 18:56.820
He's Prince Yan.

19:07.150 --> 19:07.990
Father.

19:08.000 --> 19:09.540
Give me a moment.

19:14.540 --> 19:16.670
Your Grace, you...

19:16.940 --> 19:18.300
Are you okay?

19:21.260 --> 19:22.110
Mr. Zhen,

19:22.110 --> 19:23.180
is this

19:23.180 --> 19:24.860
some kind of joke?

19:26.980 --> 19:28.810
Is it?

19:28.830 --> 19:30.520
Your Grace, Young Master Zhan,

19:30.540 --> 19:31.890
I would never joke

19:31.910 --> 19:34.670
about such a matter.

19:37.870 --> 19:40.230
Yu is a fraud.

19:41.210 --> 19:42.460
- What's wrong?
- That fraud.

19:42.460 --> 19:43.820
Your Grace?

19:45.630 --> 19:46.890
Father.

19:46.910 --> 19:48.090
Father.

19:48.110 --> 19:49.620
Wait for me.

19:51.700 --> 19:53.000
Oh, my goodness.

19:53.020 --> 19:55.030
We almost caused a disaster.

19:56.500 --> 19:58.020
Did you just say

19:58.020 --> 20:00.300
the Prince's family is destitute?

20:02.180 --> 20:04.300
You said he was an orphan first.

20:04.700 --> 20:06.380
Father, Father.

20:10.980 --> 20:12.370
Look at it now.

20:12.390 --> 20:14.130
We don't have to worry about Si

20:14.150 --> 20:16.000
marrying into a noble family.

20:16.020 --> 20:17.390
No one is more noble

20:17.390 --> 20:19.130
than Yu Qi.

20:19.150 --> 20:20.780
That's true.

20:23.910 --> 20:26.140
But if she marries
into an ordinary family

20:26.180 --> 20:27.960
and ends up with a bad match,

20:27.980 --> 20:30.380
she could still get a divorce.

20:30.590 --> 20:32.370
If she marries into the imperial family,

20:32.390 --> 20:35.100
she'll have to endure
whatever comes her way.

20:35.980 --> 20:37.340
What should we do?

20:38.980 --> 20:41.620
We can't let Si fall into this trap.

20:41.780 --> 20:44.060
- Hurry home and think of a way.
- Let's go.

21:13.430 --> 21:15.230
No one answers the door,

21:15.940 --> 21:17.910
and there's no doorman.

21:18.830 --> 21:20.820
Let's just wait here.

21:32.450 --> 21:36.930
(Haitang Chamber)

21:36.940 --> 21:39.200
Miss, why not sit down and rest?

21:39.220 --> 21:40.580
Have some water.

21:43.310 --> 21:45.760
(He hit the Crown Prince because of me.)

21:45.780 --> 21:48.470
(I wonder how the Emperor
will punish him.)

21:49.020 --> 21:51.910
Are you waiting for the news of Yu...

21:52.260 --> 21:54.300
the 7th Prince?

21:55.910 --> 21:58.060
Who says I'm waiting for his news?

21:59.070 --> 22:00.920
But this matter did start

22:00.940 --> 22:02.950
because of me.

22:03.070 --> 22:04.720
He hit the Crown Prince.

22:04.740 --> 22:06.240
If the Emperor punishes him,

22:06.260 --> 22:07.960
and something happens to him,

22:07.980 --> 22:09.780
won't I owe him then?

22:11.500 --> 22:13.030
Aman, leave us.

22:22.670 --> 22:24.680
You should owe me more,

22:24.700 --> 22:26.440
so you can't refuse to talk to me.

22:26.460 --> 22:28.380
It seems like you're perfectly fine.

22:28.940 --> 22:30.160
Indeed,

22:30.180 --> 22:32.520
the Emperor still cares about you.

22:32.540 --> 22:33.900
Wait.

22:40.500 --> 22:43.100
The Emperor has made me Prince Yan.

22:48.910 --> 22:50.270
In that case,

22:51.390 --> 22:53.380
congratulations, Your Highness.

22:58.870 --> 23:01.950
I didn't intend to hide my background
from you.

23:02.830 --> 23:05.140
I didn't think it would matter.

23:05.500 --> 23:08.200
Whether I'm a Prince or not,

23:08.220 --> 23:10.090
I don't think it'll affect us

23:10.110 --> 23:11.150
but I did have

23:11.150 --> 23:12.650
overlooked your feelings.

23:12.670 --> 23:14.670
I know you just want
to protect your family

23:14.670 --> 23:16.290
and live a peaceful life.

23:16.310 --> 23:18.030
I want the same.

23:19.180 --> 23:21.300
But only if I stand firm

23:21.460 --> 23:23.430
can I protect you.

23:23.700 --> 23:24.630
From now on,

23:24.630 --> 23:25.890
I'll tell you everything

23:25.910 --> 23:27.330
about me

23:27.350 --> 23:28.820
at once.

23:31.740 --> 23:33.680
Who wants to know everything about you?

23:33.700 --> 23:35.060
I'm very busy.

23:35.700 --> 23:37.620
But there is one thing

23:37.780 --> 23:39.140
you must know.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.950
What is it?

23:41.980 --> 23:43.340
I'm fond of you.

23:44.260 --> 23:45.110
I'm fond

23:45.110 --> 23:47.130
of Miss Jiang Si,

23:47.150 --> 23:48.710
daughter of Earl Dongping.

23:58.550 --> 24:02.120
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

24:02.140 --> 24:05.660
♪ Feelings remain
but things are complicated ♪

24:05.680 --> 24:08.930
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

24:09.270 --> 24:12.340
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

24:13.940 --> 24:15.300
But I'm afraid

24:16.180 --> 24:18.530
that even if we have feelings
for each other,

24:19.540 --> 24:21.140
it won't last.

24:21.220 --> 24:23.130
Is it because of the imperial title?

24:23.290 --> 24:24.740
Though I have an imperial title now,

24:24.740 --> 24:25.870
I'm still the Yu Qi

24:25.870 --> 24:26.830
you knew.

24:26.830 --> 24:27.870
I'm not talking about that.

24:27.870 --> 24:29.230
Then what?

24:30.970 --> 24:34.240
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

24:34.260 --> 24:36.390
Fine, even if I believe

24:36.390 --> 24:37.610
that you just want to be Yu Qi,

24:37.630 --> 24:38.740
but being a Prince

24:38.740 --> 24:40.060
isn't something you can control.

24:40.080 --> 24:41.430
Today, you got an imperial title,

24:41.430 --> 24:42.680
but what about tomorrow?

24:42.700 --> 24:44.960
How can you avoid
the political struggles?

24:44.980 --> 24:45.910
Then I can

24:45.910 --> 24:47.950
be a carefree Prince.

24:48.390 --> 24:50.330
We'll shut the door,

24:50.350 --> 24:52.470
live our own peaceful life,

24:52.500 --> 24:54.380
and we'll be happy.

24:57.260 --> 24:59.340
I'm afraid things won't go as planned.

25:03.240 --> 25:06.810
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

25:06.830 --> 25:10.490
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

25:10.540 --> 25:13.860
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

25:13.860 --> 25:17.450
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

25:17.470 --> 25:21.320
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

25:21.340 --> 25:24.900
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

25:24.920 --> 25:28.410
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

25:28.430 --> 25:30.620
Then tell me.

25:30.700 --> 25:32.720
What kind of life do you want to live?

25:33.020 --> 25:34.050
Let me hear it.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.950
I must think carefully.

25:36.670 --> 25:39.430
Take your time.

25:39.670 --> 25:41.430
There's still plenty of time.

25:42.940 --> 25:46.960
♪ The sealed memories ♪

25:46.980 --> 25:48.340
Where is she?

25:56.390 --> 25:57.850
What are you doing here?

25:57.940 --> 25:59.540
What am I doing here?

26:00.630 --> 26:02.960
Are you hiding something from me?

26:02.980 --> 26:03.820
What?

26:03.830 --> 26:05.620
A big matter.

26:05.830 --> 26:07.850
A huge matter.

26:07.870 --> 26:09.130
Tell me what you want.

26:09.150 --> 26:10.710
I have work to do.

26:11.390 --> 26:13.020
You knew all along

26:13.020 --> 26:14.780
that Yu Qi was a Prince, right?

26:16.150 --> 26:17.070
Lower your voice.

26:17.070 --> 26:18.520
There are so many people here.

26:18.540 --> 26:20.350
See? You knew it all along,

26:20.350 --> 26:21.310
and you didn't tell me.

26:21.320 --> 26:22.390
He was keeping it a secret.

26:22.400 --> 26:23.260
Do you think I should

26:23.260 --> 26:24.460
go around telling everyone?

26:24.460 --> 26:26.850
You could've told me quietly.

26:26.870 --> 26:28.820
We're so close.

26:33.390 --> 26:34.820
What do you mean?

26:37.910 --> 26:39.270
Well...

26:39.500 --> 26:40.860
Tell me.

26:50.830 --> 26:55.270
We're as close as siblings.

27:00.180 --> 27:02.270
I'm not your sibling.

27:06.070 --> 27:08.370
Don't pretend to be angry.

27:08.390 --> 27:10.950
I'm still angry.

27:11.780 --> 27:13.780
I'm angry

27:15.110 --> 27:17.230
because he's my friend, right?

27:17.590 --> 27:18.950
Aren't I

27:24.180 --> 27:26.050
also your friend?

27:26.070 --> 27:27.150
How can there be secrets

27:27.150 --> 27:28.680
between friends?

27:28.700 --> 27:30.650
You two are hiding something from me.

27:30.670 --> 27:31.890
Then

27:31.910 --> 27:33.270
let's not

27:33.910 --> 27:35.510
have secrets between us.

27:52.590 --> 27:53.460
The dog saw me,

27:53.460 --> 27:54.760
but why couldn't you?

27:54.780 --> 27:56.050
Chief.

27:56.070 --> 27:57.430
How is it?

27:58.830 --> 28:00.190
It's done?

28:01.110 --> 28:02.470
Of course.

28:03.430 --> 28:05.030
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

28:15.350 --> 28:16.740
These clothes

28:16.740 --> 28:18.160
all look too gaudy.

28:18.180 --> 28:19.610
Didn't I tell you?

28:19.630 --> 28:20.980
You should follow

28:20.980 --> 28:22.990
Earl Dongping's servants.

28:23.350 --> 28:25.230
What are you waiting for?

28:25.630 --> 28:27.270
Yes.

28:27.500 --> 28:29.190
So stupid.

28:32.350 --> 28:34.060
Your Highness.

28:34.180 --> 28:35.540
Mother.

28:36.220 --> 28:38.190
What's wrong again?

28:39.160 --> 28:40.110
The fabrics they bought

28:40.110 --> 28:41.440
weren't to my liking,

28:41.460 --> 28:42.920
so I sent them to buy again

28:42.940 --> 28:44.540
and scolded them.

28:44.700 --> 28:46.910
You've always hated Jiang Si,

28:47.180 --> 28:48.910
but now you're imitating
her dressing style

28:48.910 --> 28:50.750
to please a man.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.480
How could my daughter

28:52.500 --> 28:54.410
be so disgraceful?

28:54.430 --> 28:56.990
Yu Jin likes her that way.

28:57.260 --> 28:59.300
What can I do?

28:59.460 --> 29:00.500
But you shouldn't have

29:00.500 --> 29:03.140
urged the Crown Prince
to go to Prince Qi's Mansion.

29:03.310 --> 29:05.520
Though Cousin Lang suffered,

29:05.540 --> 29:07.220
Yu Jin benefited from misfortune

29:07.220 --> 29:09.050
and was granted an imperial title.

29:09.070 --> 29:10.760
Isn't he a perfect match for me now?

29:10.780 --> 29:12.750
But he carries an ill omen.

29:12.980 --> 29:14.220
Even if he is Prince Yan now,

29:14.220 --> 29:16.060
he won't amount to much.

29:16.160 --> 29:17.330
If you want to get married,

29:17.350 --> 29:19.090
you must marry the Crown Prince.

29:19.110 --> 29:21.270
I'll pave the way for you,

29:21.460 --> 29:22.440
and one day,

29:22.460 --> 29:24.670
you'll become the dignified Empress.

29:24.670 --> 29:27.090
Who would care about that?

29:27.110 --> 29:29.330
Look at Empress Di
and the Crown Princess.

29:29.350 --> 29:31.380
They both have to listen to you.

29:31.440 --> 29:32.740
You're now the most honored woman

29:32.740 --> 29:34.710
in Dazhou.

29:34.910 --> 29:36.470
All I want

29:38.700 --> 29:41.140
is to marry the man I love.

29:44.220 --> 29:47.340
You like him, but does he like you?

29:49.590 --> 29:50.430
Do you think

29:50.430 --> 29:52.950
you can win a man's heart

29:53.180 --> 29:55.670
just with your feelings?

29:59.070 --> 30:00.430
Mother,

30:00.460 --> 30:01.670
the young men

30:01.670 --> 30:04.270
around me these years

30:04.430 --> 30:06.570
all sought power

30:06.590 --> 30:08.760
and wanted to use us,

30:08.780 --> 30:10.540
but Yu Jin is different.

30:12.020 --> 30:14.540
Since he saved me
from the Jinshui River,

30:15.830 --> 30:17.430
I've been determined.

30:19.780 --> 30:21.410
I can give up everything.

30:21.430 --> 30:23.230
I just ask for this one thing.

30:23.590 --> 30:25.670
Please, Mother, help me.

30:25.830 --> 30:28.100
You never like something long.

30:28.740 --> 30:29.830
How do you know

30:29.830 --> 30:32.270
it's not just a fleeting impulse?

30:35.220 --> 30:37.430
Even if it's a fleeting impulse,

30:39.740 --> 30:41.510
I still want him.

30:42.770 --> 30:46.290
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

30:50.020 --> 30:52.470
Tonight is my wedding night,

30:53.110 --> 30:54.990
yet as the Grand Princess,

30:55.110 --> 30:56.350
you're forcing me to write

30:56.350 --> 30:57.900
a letter of severance

30:57.920 --> 30:58.940
just because your daughter

30:58.940 --> 31:00.710
likes my husband?

31:01.260 --> 31:03.060
I can kill Yu Qi

31:03.110 --> 31:06.230
anytime, anywhere.

31:07.020 --> 31:08.620
Jiang Si,

31:09.780 --> 31:11.910
even if I die,

31:12.310 --> 31:15.620
your life will never change.

31:16.390 --> 31:19.060
You two will never be together.

31:26.700 --> 31:28.010
(Qi)
Miss, look.

31:28.020 --> 31:29.910
It's to seek your forgiveness.

31:34.670 --> 31:36.100
I'm fond of you.

31:37.020 --> 31:39.760
I'm fond of Miss Jiang Si,

31:39.780 --> 31:41.340
daughter of Earl Dongping.

31:43.590 --> 31:45.100
This time,

31:48.670 --> 31:51.780
can we really stay together?

32:04.390 --> 32:05.290
Chief,

32:05.310 --> 32:07.430
many documents are waiting for you.

32:08.110 --> 32:10.670
I'll just go look at her.

32:15.070 --> 32:16.430
Your Highness.

32:20.110 --> 32:22.730
Your Highness, Prince Yan's Mansion
is under construction

32:22.730 --> 32:23.890
as per the Emperor's command.

32:23.910 --> 32:26.620
Your Highness, please come and see.

32:27.830 --> 32:28.670
Okay.

32:28.690 --> 32:31.790
(From His Majesty, Prince Yan's Mansion,
23rd year of Jingming)

32:44.570 --> 32:47.810
(Majesty and Prestige)

32:54.130 --> 32:58.290
(Await the Moon)

33:01.070 --> 33:02.410
Your Highness,

33:02.430 --> 33:03.890
what do you think

33:03.910 --> 33:05.910
of the mansion?

33:07.390 --> 33:08.750
It's good,

33:09.110 --> 33:11.410
but something seems to be missing.

33:11.430 --> 33:13.520
Your Highness, if you want something,

33:13.540 --> 33:15.050
please let me know,

33:15.070 --> 33:17.540
and I'll take care of it
right away.

33:41.980 --> 33:44.860
What about a pavilion here?

33:46.500 --> 33:47.860
No.

33:47.940 --> 33:49.400
Plant a crabapple tree.

33:50.630 --> 33:52.750
A thousand-year-old crabapple.

33:54.200 --> 33:56.600
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

33:56.620 --> 34:00.280
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

34:00.300 --> 34:03.720
♪ Growing between us ♪

34:03.870 --> 34:09.390
♪ And breeding love ♪

34:10.660 --> 34:13.350
That's the western yard.

34:13.830 --> 34:15.660
It's under construction.

34:17.270 --> 34:18.900
Chief, Chief.

34:18.910 --> 34:20.000
Over here.

34:20.020 --> 34:21.710
This mansion is too big.

34:21.710 --> 34:23.040
Come here and have a look.

34:23.060 --> 34:25.210
Your Highness, this way, please.

34:25.230 --> 34:26.740
Sure, lead the way.

34:41.790 --> 34:43.510
Your Highness.

34:43.910 --> 34:45.430
Your Highness.

34:58.230 --> 35:01.180
I'm Zhen Heng from Capital Security.

35:01.270 --> 35:03.480
Greetings, Your Highness.

35:03.500 --> 35:04.860
Mr. Zhen,

35:04.910 --> 35:07.210
what brings you here?

35:07.230 --> 35:08.770
I heard

35:08.790 --> 35:11.370
that you're moving today,

35:11.390 --> 35:13.460
so I came to offer my congratulations.

35:13.460 --> 35:14.910
Did you just hit the Dengwen Drum?

35:14.910 --> 35:15.940
Is your brain okay?

35:15.940 --> 35:17.810
It's okay.

35:17.830 --> 35:19.290
I'm just a bit nervous.

35:19.310 --> 35:21.770
How considerate of you.

35:21.790 --> 35:23.580
I will never fail

35:23.580 --> 35:25.210
your great expectations.

35:25.230 --> 35:28.290
I'd like to do anything

35:28.310 --> 35:30.620
to serve you.

35:36.580 --> 35:38.480
Come on, bring them in.

35:38.500 --> 35:39.990
Bring them in.

35:45.140 --> 35:45.980
Place them here.

35:45.980 --> 35:47.340
Here. Put them here.

35:48.620 --> 35:50.600
Your Highness, look.

35:50.620 --> 35:53.210
This is jade-green, lustrous as jade.

35:53.230 --> 35:56.180
It's the Taohe Green Inkstone.

35:56.460 --> 35:57.770
Now, look here.

35:57.790 --> 35:59.330
This is Wanshe Ink.

35:59.350 --> 36:01.940
It's glossy like lacquer,
with a good fragrance.

36:01.940 --> 36:04.920
It's a rare treasure.

36:04.940 --> 36:06.210
Look at this.

36:06.230 --> 36:07.920
This celadon-glazed pitcher

36:07.940 --> 36:09.310
and the gilded box

36:09.310 --> 36:10.410
are personally selected

36:10.430 --> 36:12.520
by me for you.

36:12.540 --> 36:14.290
What's wrong with Mr. Zhen?

36:14.310 --> 36:15.290
He's gone mad.

36:15.310 --> 36:16.370
By the way,

36:16.390 --> 36:18.950
I have one more thing.

36:19.710 --> 36:23.310
This is a gold-carved jade-inlaid

36:23.390 --> 36:25.060
little turtle.

36:25.830 --> 36:27.690
These are all small gifts

36:27.710 --> 36:29.960
from me.

36:29.980 --> 36:32.870
Your Highness, please accept them.

36:44.140 --> 36:46.730
Since you have such filial piety,

36:46.750 --> 36:48.060
then I have to accept

36:48.060 --> 36:50.350
these precious gifts.

36:52.940 --> 36:54.430
It's my honor.

36:54.430 --> 36:55.830
Enough.

36:55.980 --> 36:58.470
You've flattered me enough.

37:04.430 --> 37:06.790
I dare flatter

37:06.940 --> 37:08.580
anyone,

37:09.620 --> 37:12.060
but I can't

37:12.230 --> 37:14.220
flatter you now.

37:17.450 --> 37:19.530
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

37:19.540 --> 37:21.910
Captain Xie, why have you
come to Ling'an?

37:22.540 --> 37:24.510
I resigned from my post in Lingshui

37:25.390 --> 37:27.430
and planned to settle in Ling'an.

37:28.060 --> 37:29.420
Why?

37:31.500 --> 37:32.990
Miss Jiang,

37:33.660 --> 37:35.140
do you really not know?

37:37.980 --> 37:40.140
You're extraordinary.

37:40.190 --> 37:42.390
Whether in Lingshui or Ling'an,

37:42.460 --> 37:44.580
many noble ladies would like you.

37:44.980 --> 37:47.340
- You shouldn't...
- I once missed my chance,

37:49.540 --> 37:51.450
and I don't want to miss it again.

37:52.940 --> 37:55.100
She's the only woman I want to marry.

37:55.910 --> 37:57.270
You know it.

38:10.710 --> 38:12.560
I've made up my mind,

38:12.580 --> 38:14.160
and I won't marry anyone.

38:16.870 --> 38:18.810
Since I returned home,

38:18.830 --> 38:20.430
I've been with my family,

38:21.230 --> 38:23.470
watching Yan grow day by day.

38:23.580 --> 38:25.410
My life has been simple and peaceful,

38:25.430 --> 38:27.310
and I don't have to please anyone.

38:27.940 --> 38:29.660
I'm very content

38:30.140 --> 38:31.580
with my life now.

38:33.270 --> 38:36.260
From now on, I only want this.

38:41.870 --> 38:44.580
Captain Xie, I'm sorry.

38:46.660 --> 38:48.310
I was being abrupt.

38:48.940 --> 38:50.790
I expressed my feelings

38:51.580 --> 38:54.030
without asking how you felt first.

38:54.060 --> 38:55.870
You're doing well now,

38:56.140 --> 38:57.910
and I'm happy for you.

38:58.620 --> 39:00.770
I've waited in Lingshui for seven years.

39:01.830 --> 39:03.660
I don't mind another seven years.

39:04.190 --> 39:05.950
As long as you're willing,

39:07.100 --> 39:08.950
I'll always be behind you.

39:29.170 --> 39:36.650
(Jiang)

39:49.060 --> 39:50.540
Princess Fuqing.

39:51.910 --> 39:53.430
Please take it.

39:53.500 --> 39:54.870
It's you?

39:55.500 --> 39:56.440
It's me.

39:56.460 --> 39:57.890
I'm surprised you remember me.

39:57.910 --> 39:59.270
Your Highness!

40:00.710 --> 40:02.000
Mr. Zhen.

40:02.020 --> 40:03.120
Eunuch Liu.

40:03.140 --> 40:04.510
Mr. Zhen.

40:06.750 --> 40:08.040
Thank you.

40:08.060 --> 40:09.410
My pleasure, Your Highness.

40:09.430 --> 40:10.370
Your Highness,

40:10.390 --> 40:12.560
please stop playing
with that bamboo bird.

40:12.580 --> 40:13.790
If you're hurt,

40:13.790 --> 40:17.170
how will I explain it to His Majesty?

40:17.190 --> 40:19.180
I was supposed to fly a kite,

40:19.270 --> 40:21.540
but unfortunately,
I couldn't see anything.

40:25.540 --> 40:26.890
Your Highness,

40:26.910 --> 40:28.350
I know a kite

40:28.350 --> 40:29.850
that can talk.

40:29.870 --> 40:31.250
Even if you can't see it,

40:31.270 --> 40:32.440
you can hear it

40:32.460 --> 40:34.170
and know where it flies.

40:34.190 --> 40:35.660
It can talk?

40:36.270 --> 40:38.560
Does such a thing exist?

40:38.580 --> 40:39.560
It does.

40:39.580 --> 40:41.770
Next time I enter the Palace,

40:41.790 --> 40:43.250
I'll bring one for you.

40:43.430 --> 40:44.890
That'd be great, Mr. Zhen.

40:44.910 --> 40:46.540
Thank you, Mr. Zhen.

40:47.060 --> 40:48.580
It's my honor.

40:55.430 --> 40:57.080
You suddenly treated me to a meal.

40:57.100 --> 40:58.410
Is there something you need?

40:58.430 --> 40:59.340
No.

40:59.360 --> 41:00.460
I just wanted to treat you

41:00.460 --> 41:02.180
to some noodles.

41:05.310 --> 41:07.350
Speaking of noodles,

41:07.910 --> 41:09.290
for some reason,

41:09.310 --> 41:11.030
it makes me think of my sister.

41:12.500 --> 41:14.060
You don't know.

41:14.190 --> 41:15.910
My sister

41:16.230 --> 41:17.810
has a lot of flaws.

41:17.830 --> 41:18.610
For example,

41:18.630 --> 41:20.310
she sometimes takes things
too seriously,

41:20.310 --> 41:21.940
which makes those who aren't serious

41:21.940 --> 41:23.080
feel embarrassed.

41:23.100 --> 41:24.000
Also,

41:24.020 --> 41:25.100
she has a stubborn temper.

41:25.100 --> 41:26.400
When she gets stubborn,

41:26.400 --> 41:27.620
even nine oxen can't stop her.

41:27.620 --> 41:28.600
There's more.

41:28.620 --> 41:30.100
Sometimes when she's fierce,

41:30.100 --> 41:31.060
even I, her brother,

41:31.060 --> 41:32.420
get scared.

41:33.940 --> 41:35.660
Why are you telling me this?

41:39.710 --> 41:41.740
I want you to talk

41:42.060 --> 41:45.410
to your senior

41:45.430 --> 41:46.600
and persuade him.

41:46.620 --> 41:49.390
There are many adorable ladies.

41:51.100 --> 41:53.390
People are often asked
to put in a good word,

41:53.940 --> 41:55.700
but you're asking me

41:55.940 --> 41:57.560
to speak ill of Miss Jiang?

41:57.580 --> 41:59.350
Qi's finally found someone he likes.

41:59.350 --> 42:01.140
I can't bring myself to say this.

42:03.060 --> 42:04.580
I can't beat him,

42:04.580 --> 42:06.350
and now he's a Prince.

42:06.790 --> 42:08.770
If he bullies my sister in the future,

42:08.790 --> 42:10.430
who will be able to stop him?

42:13.350 --> 42:14.190
Another bowl.

42:14.210 --> 42:17.450
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

42:17.460 --> 42:18.820
Your Highness.

42:19.270 --> 42:20.520
Uncle, how are you?

42:20.540 --> 42:22.200
Your Highness, you came in person.

42:22.200 --> 42:23.810
Sorry for not welcoming you properly.

42:23.830 --> 42:25.390
Sorry for not welcoming you properly.

42:25.390 --> 42:26.870
It's okay.

42:27.830 --> 42:30.790
Uncle, I'll go find Si.

42:31.270 --> 42:32.630
Your Highness.

42:37.540 --> 42:41.480
You've been away from home
since childhood,

42:41.500 --> 42:43.040
fighting alone

42:43.060 --> 42:45.040
on the frontier battlefield,

42:45.060 --> 42:47.790
and achieving great military feats.

42:48.870 --> 42:50.810
Now, in Ling'an,

42:50.830 --> 42:52.790
you're leading Capital Security,

42:52.790 --> 42:55.790
solving cases, and upholding justice.

42:55.980 --> 42:58.600
You're truly a talented

42:58.620 --> 43:00.910
and extraordinary young man.

43:01.710 --> 43:03.700
Uncle, you flatter me.

43:03.980 --> 43:05.370
But Your Highness,

43:05.390 --> 43:07.620
I can't entrust Si

43:08.020 --> 43:09.910
to you.

43:12.010 --> 43:16.290
(The End of Episode 25)

43:16.781 --> 43:18.511
♪ From place to place ♪

43:18.511 --> 43:23.451
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:23.821 --> 43:26.201
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:26.201 --> 43:30.431
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:31.141 --> 43:33.541
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:33.561 --> 43:37.221
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:37.241 --> 43:40.661
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:40.811 --> 43:46.331
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:47.151 --> 43:50.831
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:50.831 --> 43:54.911
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:55.151 --> 43:56.891
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:56.911 --> 44:01.611
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

44:01.611 --> 44:05.181
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:05.201 --> 44:09.431
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:09.451 --> 44:11.231
♪ Time glows ♪

44:11.231 --> 44:15.771
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:15.791 --> 44:20.591
♪ And stars ♪

44:24.821 --> 44:27.351
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:27.371 --> 44:30.991
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:31.011 --> 44:34.441
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:34.461 --> 44:39.081
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:39.081 --> 44:42.771
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:42.791 --> 44:46.881
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:46.991 --> 44:48.811
♪ Time glows ♪

44:48.811 --> 44:53.361
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:53.381 --> 44:57.081
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:57.101 --> 45:01.261
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

45:01.441 --> 45:03.201
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

45:03.201 --> 45:07.721
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

45:07.721 --> 45:11.361
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:11.381 --> 45:17.051
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:18.741 --> 45:20.671
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:20.671 --> 45:28.171
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
